          <span class="section-label">Three Performance Levels</span>
          <h2>Matched to How the Court Will Be Used</h2>
          <p>Every court and facility sees a different level of use. CushionX comes in three distinct composition levels, so the system you install actually fits the demand it will see.</p>
          <h3>Level 1 — Residential</h3>
          <p>Designed for private backyard courts and lightly-used home facilities where comfort and feel matter most.</p>
          <h3>Level 2 — HOA, Club &amp; Community</h3>
          <p>Built for neighborhood courts, HOA amenities, and private clubs with moderate, consistent daily use.</p>
          <h3>Level 3 — Commercial &amp; High-Traffic</h3>
          <p>The top-tier composition for commercial facilities, municipal courts, and high-traffic programming where durability and force reduction both have to hold up under constant play.</p>
        </div>
