  <section class="content-block">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="text-center section-title">Two System Types</h2>
      <div class="content-two-col">
        <div class="content-card">
          <h3>Mat Overlay System</h3>
          <p>A factory-produced cushion mat is rolled out, adhered, and seamed onto the prepared base. Predictable thickness, consistent feel across the entire surface, and fast turnaround make this a strong choice for high-use courts and larger projects.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Uniform cushion thickness court-wide</li>
            <li>Fast on-site installation</li>
            <li>Latex or urethane adhesive options</li>
            <li>Ideal for commercial and club-level courts</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="content-card">
          <h3>Squeegee Applied System</h3>
          <p>Cushion layers are applied on-site and built up to the chosen thickness. The result is a monolithic surface with excellent bond characteristics and a consistent feel, installed by certified applicators with factory-grade equipment.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Built up on-site to 4mm, 6mm, or 8mm</li>
            <li>Seamless, monolithic surface</li>
            <li>Squeegee or spray application</li>
            <li>Great for residential and club courts</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

